  "appVersion": "App version",
  "privacyBody": "Smart Dukan keeps all your data on this phone, in an encrypted database. There is no account and no server, and the app sends nothing over the internet.\n\nWhat is stored: your shop profile, products, stock, customers and suppliers, sales, purchases, payments, expenses, repair jobs and instalment plans.\n\nPhotos: bill photos, device photos and (only if you switch it on) seller CNIC photos are encrypted with a key kept in the phone’s secure keystore. CNIC photos are deleted automatically after the retention period you choose. Only the owner and managers can view CNIC details, and every view is logged.\n\nSharing: data leaves the phone only when you share an invoice, statement or report, or save a backup. Backups are always encrypted with your backup password.\n\nNo analytics, no ads, no tracking. Play Data Safety: no data collected or shared.",
  "termsBody": "Mobile Shop Pro is a one-time licence for one device. It includes bug fixes and compatibility updates.\n\nTransfer: if you change phones, restore your backup on the new phone and send both Device Codes on WhatsApp. The seller issues a new code for the new phone and marks the old licence as transferred.\n\nKnown limitation: an offline app cannot revoke a copied licence. The licence is bound to your Device Code to make sharing hard, and the seller keeps a register (licence id, Device Code, buyer phone, date) for transfers and disputes.\n\nYour records always stay yours: if Pro is not active, Pro records remain readable and exportable.",
  "helpVideosBody": "Short videos on recording a sale, adding stock, khata and backup are on our WhatsApp channel. Ask your seller for the link.",
